<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Dries, Kloof declare final divs.</title>
<headline>Dries, Kloof declare final divs.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Driefontein Consolidated Ltd and Kloof Gold Mining Co Ltd have declared final dividends of 75 cents and 15 cents a share respectively, the companies said in a joint statement on Friday..</p>
<p>The dividends would paid on August 6 to shareholders registered in their books on June 27.</p>
<p>The statement added that Deelkraal Gold Mining Co. Ltd, which is also in the Gold Fields Group stable, had not declared a final dividend.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
